<title>MEXICO: April foreign investment in Mexico securities up.</title>
<headline>April foreign investment in Mexico securities up.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investment in Mexican securities rose 1.51 percent in April to $38.278 billion from $37.710 billion on March 31, the Mexican Stock Exchange (BMV) said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said foreign investment in stocks rose 1.13 percent to $34.531 billion, while in the money market it rose 5.15 percent to $3.746 billion in April from the month before.  </p>
